msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(The mahjong parlor on East Hatsumachi... I'm sure they've\r\n"
"been waiting for their soba.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hello? Your Okinawan soba delivery has arrived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Finally! Geez, could you be any later? I got so hungry\r\n"
"waiting that I had to stuff, like, ten onigiri in my mouth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Here's your money. Just make it snappy next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(That's all my deliveries. Now to get back to that Okinawa\r\n"
"soba joint.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "(Okay, time to find my next customer.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"(The mahjong parlor along the Kubochi River... I'm sure\r\n"
"they've been waiting for their soba.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Hello? Your Okinawan soba delivery has arrived!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"My beloved pork rib noodles have arrived at last! Mmm, and\r\n"
"it smells divine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I've got to eat them at least once a week, you know. Well,\r\n"
"here's what I owe you. Thanks for coming out this way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
